WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:05.500
The Eighteenth Year of Yuankang

00:09.120 --> 00:12.500
This year, the Ministry of Revenue has tallied total tax revenues at over eighteen million taels.

00:12.680 --> 00:20.000
Disaster relief for Qing Province—grain, seed, and farm implements totaling two million taels—is already en route and will arrive shortly.

00:20.160 --> 00:21.500
Good!

00:22.400 --> 00:32.500
In this Qing Province unrest, Chancellor Chen stepped in with prompt resolution and deft handling. Chancellor Chen, the chief credit belongs to you!

00:33.240 --> 00:35.200
Your subject is humbled, Your Majesty.

00:35.600 --> 00:46.500
That this calamity was averted so swiftly is entirely due to Your Majesty's boundless grace, and the Prince of Ning's tireless governance in Qing Province.

00:47.400 --> 00:52.500
Resuming the Qing Province canal has lifted a heavy burden from Zhen's mind.

00:53.680 --> 00:57.000
Do my ministers have any further memorials to present?

00:58.480 --> 01:02.000
Imperial Father, your son has a humble petition for your gracious approval.

01:02.040 --> 01:03.800
Speak freely. What is it?

01:03.960 --> 01:14.500
The eldest daughter of the Chen clan is pure of heart and refined in grace; your son has long admired her. Chancellor Chen has been like a mentor to me—I pray Father may bestow this marriage upon us!

01:16.960 --> 01:24.500
Zhen recalls this young lady. When I last saw her, she boldly asked me for a court post—Zhen nearly granted it!

01:25.320 --> 01:30.600
Forgive her, Your Majesty. Wan'er lost her father at an early age and grew up somewhat willful.

01:30.800 --> 01:40.000
Yet your subject has always hoped to find her a worthy match. If she could receive the Prince of Ning's affection, it would be Wan'er's greatest blessing.

01:41.720 --> 01:43.500
(This...)
